WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Agent Cost Governor: a budget the agent cannot exceed — per task, per step, per model — enforced inside the agent loop, before the invoice.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The problem: inference cost per agentic workflow is set to rise more than fivefold through 2028; one accounting agent burned $50,000 in under an hour with no attacker; and cloud billing alerts arrive about a day late.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:29.000
What it does: a cost ceiling per task; step, depth and spawn caps; a model lock; a server-side circuit breaker; nightly reconciliation against the provider bill; and a weekly cost-per-task report.

4
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:41.000
The deliverable: a weekly report your platform lead, your CFO and your auditor can all read — cost per resolved case before and after, tasks halted at the ceiling, escalations blocked, reconciliation drift. The figures shown are a sample.

5
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:50.000
How it ships: week one, the gateway is deployed in your cloud; week two, policies; week three, shadow mode — logged, not blocked; week four, enforcement and the first report.

6
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Published prices: included in the Run and Improve retainer, or $2,500 to $5,000 a month standalone per estate.

7
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.000
In build, pilots from December 2026. Tell us the estate size at rainkernel.com or hello@rainkernel.com.
